  "title": "Scalloped Tomatoes",
  "description": "These scalloped tomatoes are made with basil, brown sugar, bread cubes, and onions cooked with thick, juicy slices of tomato and baked in the oven until your kitchen smells wonderful.",
  "authors": [
    "Linda"
  ],
